  "CHAT_WORK_NO_NO_I_DONT_NEED_ANY_HELP": "No no... I don't need any help.",
  "CHAT_WORK_WELL_BE_HERE": "Well in any case, we'll always be here.",
  "CHAT_WORK_I_NEED_TO_DO_THIS_ON_MY_OWN": "It's okay! I need to do this on my own.",
  "CHAT_WORK_LETS_CIRCLE_BACK": "Okay. Let's circle back to this next Thursday. Have a good weekend.",

