  "THERAPY_THE_YOU_THAT_EXISTS_INSIDE": ["The you that exists inside."],
  "THERAPY_YOUR_THOUGHTS_ARE_VOICES": [
    "Your thoughts are the disembodied voices of people in the past, echoing through time."
